<title>BELGIUM: EU beet sugar output forecast at 15.42 mln tns.</title>
<headline>EU beet sugar output forecast at 15.42 mln tns.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The latest European Union beet sugar production forecast was 15.417 million tonnes in 1996/97 (July/June), a shade down on a previous estimate and still below last year, trade sources said, quoting Commission figures.</p>
<p>&quot;The new forecast compares with 15.636 million tonnes last season and is down slightly because of the cold spring and dry month of May,&quot; a trade source said.</p>
<p>The new Commission forecast shows a drop in the French figure to 4.07 million tonnes from 4.16 million previously estimated.</p>
<p>The average yield forecast is reduced from 7.70 tonnes per hectare from 7.65. All other estimates remain unchanged.</p>
<p>The forecast put cane production in French overseas territories and Spain at 280,000 tonnes and molasses at 19,000 tonnes, making total EU sugar output 15.716 million tonnes compared with last year's 15.912 million (beet, cane and molasses).</p>
<p>A Commission official said the forecasts are provisional and are likely to change once the beet harvest is completed.</p>
<p>Sowings were slightly down on last year with the EU total for 1996/97 at 2.014 million hectares compared with 2.086 million in 1995/96. EU sugar production estimates were -</p>
<p>						   1996/97 1995/96</p>
<p> Area (million/ha)				 2,014    2,086</p>
<p> White Sugar  Yield (t/ha  )	     7.65     7.50</p>
<p> Beet sugar				   15.417   15.636</p>
<p> Cane sugar				    0.280    0.257</p>
<p> Molasses					0.19     0.19</p>
<p> Total output				 15.716   15.912</p>
<p> Carryover from previous season	  0.685    0.535</p>
<p> Total supplies (beet output + carry) 16.102   16.447</p>
<p> Of which  &quot;A&quot; Quota			11.724   11.723</p>
<p>	     &quot;B&quot; Quota			 2.359    2.405</p>
<p>	     &quot;C&quot; Non-Quota		   2.318    2.319</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>  Carry forward to next season	   0.900    0.683</p>
<p>  exports (C sugar)			  1.418    1.636</p>
<p> Consumption				  12.600   12.650</p>
